{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-75zw-b2u3-j56t-b2hz","published":"2026-11-18T20:32:32Z","modified":"2026-11-18T21:45:08.833532624Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-125283"],"summary":"When NGINX Plus or NGINX Open Source is configured to use the try_files and alias directives with a map variable…","details":"When NGINX Plus or NGINX Open Source is configured to use the try_files and alias directives with a map variable, certain combinations of regular expression captures in map and try_files can cause a segmentation fault in an NGINX worker process.\n\nImpact:\nAn attacker could leverage this vulnerability to cause an NGINX worker process to terminate unexpectedly. There is no control plane exposure; this is a data plane issue only.\n\n\n\nNote: Software versions which have reached End of Technical Support (EoTS) are not evaluated.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"nginx-mainline","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.24","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/nginx-mainline"},"versions":["1.29.8-r0","1.29.8-r1","1.31.2-r0","1.31.2-r1","1.31.2-r2","1.31.3-r2","1.31.3-r3","1.31.4-r4","1.31.5-r4","1.31.6-r4","1.31.7-r4","1.31.8-r4","1.31.8-r5","1.31.9-r5"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-75zw-b2u3-j56t-b2hz.json"}},{"package":{"name":"nginx-stable","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.24","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/nginx-stable"},"versions":["1.28.3-r0","1.28.3-r1","1.30.3-r1","1.30.3-r2","1.30.3-r3","1.30.4-r2","1.30.4-r5","1.30.4-r6","1.30.5-r4","1.30.6-r4","1.30.6-r5","1.30.7-r5"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-75zw-b2u3-j56t-b2hz.json"}},{"package":{"name":"nginx","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.24","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/nginx"},"versions":["1.28.3-r0","1.28.3-r1","1.29.8-r0","1.29.8-r1","1.30.3-r1","1.30.3-r2","1.30.4-r2","1.30.4-r5","1.30.4-r6","1.30.5-r4","1.31.2-r0","1.31.2